    "descriptionZh": "Pitch 是在线演示文稿工作区，从一句 prompt 直接生成整套幻灯片，团队在同一处改稿、套品牌模板并按客户数据批量出稿。顶部横幅宣告 MCP 与 API 已开放，可把 Pitch 接进 AI 工具链。",
    "takeawayZh": "写一句 prompt，直接生成可交付的销售演示稿",
    "noteZh": "首屏紫底，一句被虚化处理的 Create slides that win.，正中间一个白色输入框已经填好 Generate a sales presentation for a digital marketplace，框内左下角挂着 Prompts，右下角是紫色 Generate 按钮。背景压着一片模板缩略图，能认出 Business Model Canvas、THE EDITORIAL TEMPLATE、BRAND BRIEF、Agency PROPOSAL、NEWBIE PARTNERSHIP PROPOSAL 几块。框下写 From prompt to presentation, 4M+ teams create and deliver winning slides together in Pitch.。最顶上一条紫色横幅写 Pitch's MCP & API are here: Plug Pitch into your AI stack for on-brand presentations.。",
